{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__18_.gif?t=1748815391\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>99 Fails is a 2D side-scrolling open world RPG set in Zeebo's surreal nightmare to music by legendary David Wise, set in a new universe and franchise called Neebota.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/FJ-99fails-SteamHeader1.gif?t=1748815391\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An open story-rich 2D world to delve into where you get to unlock all Zeebo's morphs, offering new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interconnected dreamworld spanning many zones and areas you can explore at your leisure, provided you have the right abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre and fantastical enemies and bosses for you to beat and keep track of in your dream journal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together Zeebo's story as you collect the mental hints tucked away in his dreamworld.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/Spacer.png?t=1748815391\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/FJ-_99_fails_-_Steam_Header__Arcade.gif?t=1748815391\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/Spacer.png?t=1748815391\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try your hand at constrained gameplay to conquer specific challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat friends &amp; foes in PVP arcade up to 4 players online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the ultimate challenge in endless playthrough.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with an endless amount of people in the same session.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win fame &amp; glory by being number one during checkpoint events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/Spacer.png?t=1748815391\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/FJ_-_99_Fails_-_Steam_Gif_-_Bed_of_Rebirth_fast.gif?t=1748815391\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2164500?t=1748815391","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2164500?t=1748815391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748815391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748815391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164500/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__18_.gif?t=1748815391\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>99 Fails is a 2D side-scrolling open world RPG set in Zeebo's surreal nightmare to music by legendary David Wise, set in a new uni